WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:42.830
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:50.200
With our memories fading

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:57.280
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:04.180
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:38.260
Okay!  My turn!

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:41.260
I summon Buster Blader!

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:45.510
Nice!

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:46.700
Do it!

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:49.170
Anzu!

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:50.600
S-Shizuka?

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:53.660
Hello!

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:59.660
Signs

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:03.170
Sorry to drag you along.

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:07.160
But I want to see this city before I leave.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:13.680
Where my brother fought in the Battle City Tournament.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:15.680
It's fine.  Don't worry about it.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:17.840
Let's go!

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:30.430
He looks just like Yugi.

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:31.940
Yeah.

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:39.800
The other Yugi's search for his lost memories started when he saw this tablet.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:48.980
What's this?

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.690
It's a picture of the ancient Egyptian Pharaoh.

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:58.120
It's definitely me!

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:02.390
Why is Yugi on this tablet?

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:04.130
The Millennium Puzzle?

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:08.170
Anzu.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:11.970
I now know who I am.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:19.570
The spirit of the ancient Egyptian Pharaoh that lives inside the Millennium Puzzle.

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:21.600
That's who I am!

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:27.690
Did Yugi get this spirit because he solved the Millennium Puzzle?

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:33.690
Since so much time has passed, no wonder I lost my memories.

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:36.060
I've been waiting for you.

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:40.430
Who are you?

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:42.730
I am Ishizu Ishtar.

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:50.160
For 3,000 years, my family has guarded a portion of the Pharaoh's memories.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:51.480
That's...

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.150
A Millennium Item!

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:58.220
This is where we first met Ishizu.

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:02.720
She also had a Millennium Item.

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:09.730
And the person confronting Yugi...

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:14.160
It looks like him.

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:15.470
Can it be?

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:22.470
If it's him, this tablet symbolizes our current state in the present day.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:29.280
In order to solve every mystery, I must restore my memories.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.980
That tablet was surprising.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:38.140
Right?

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:40.590
I was surprised when I saw it too.

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:47.800
This is where Jonouchi fought his first duel in Battle City.

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:49.530
How about you?

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:53.520
Jonouchi, don't do it!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.420
His name is Espa Roba.

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:57.480
He's a psychic duelist.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.710
Psychic?

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:03.040
Yeah.  He uses ESP to know our strategies.

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:05.220
There's no way you can win.

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:09.050
I don't know if you have ESP, but I'll take you on!

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:11.020
You idiot!  Don't do it, Jonouchi!

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:15.000
I cheered for him from the hospital.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:19.770
Since I couldn't see, Honda explained what he saw on the internet.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.030
You're right.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.140
I wonder how Jonouchi is doing.

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:27.910
Did I miss the moment he won?

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.520
That's enough.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:36.250
Thank you, Honda.  But you don't need to pretend anymore.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:40.750
The nurse told me the truth.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.920
My brother is losing, right?

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:46.500
I'm sorry.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.260
I didn't want you to worry.

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:55.270
I understand, but I want to know the truth.

00:05:55.270 --> 00:06:00.500
If my brother is fighting hard, then I want to cheer him on.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:05.890
My victory is certain!

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:08.570
There's no point continuing this duel!

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:11.020
Surrender!

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.860
Sorry, Yugi.

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:22.400
It seems I can't keep our promise.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:25.520
Shizuka is watching you!

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:29.100
Jonouchi!

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.470
Anzu...

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.850
Honda called me.

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:36.140
She's watching your duel on the internet.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:40.010
Honda is providing the play-by-play.

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:40.880
Honda?

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:45.700
So do your best, Jonouchi!

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.210
The breeze feels nice.

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:54.920
Domino Pier.

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.930
I'll never forget what happened here.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.220
Me neither.

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.160
Look closely.

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:16.250
There's also a bomb on the chain holding this container.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:16.980
What?

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:22.450
If you try anything funny, I'll press this button and drop the container on her.

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:23.450
Anzu!

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.460
Where am I?

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:30.960
Yugi, you go first.

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:40.040
How should I duel when the one who loses his life points literally loses his life?

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:41.860
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:43.540
Bring out your monster!

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:50.250
Jonouchi and I were under Marik's control.

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:54.280
And you showed up during this horrible situation.

00:07:55.440 --> 00:08:01.510
The first thing I wanted to see when I removed my bandages was my brother's face.

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:04.790
But I never imagined I'd see him like that.

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:21.370
I don't have time to grab my key!

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.580
Big brother!

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:34.020
Jonouchi!

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.260
Honda!

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:42.380
Yugi!

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:51.970
Jonouchi...

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.140
I'm sorry, Yugi.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.550
And thank you.

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:58.380
Yugi!

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:08.780
Shizuka...

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:14.020
I used to be so far away, but I'm now standing right next to you.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:18.440
Because your friends helped me.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:23.220
I finally found you.

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:29.780
When you suddenly jumped into the water, you scared me.

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:35.560
Then we boarded the Battle Ship.

00:09:35.560 --> 00:09:37.790
Battle Ship, take off!

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:48.120
The three Divine Beasts that live inside the God Cards.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:55.400
They appeared before us for the first time in the Duel Field in the sky.

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:09.260
I tribute Dark Magician Girl, Gamma The Magnet Warrior and Big Shield Gardna!

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:12.220
Descend, Slifer!

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:47.820
Ra's sphere is changing shape!

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:51.130
What's this?

00:10:57.470 --> 00:11:02.240
Arise for my victory, The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:07.140
This is The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.960
I'll let you see a God!

00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:15.620
Come!  Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:33.890
It's getting chilly.

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:35.040
Let's go.

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:36.060
Yeah.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:03.130
I tribute Rocket Warrior to summon Jinzo!

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:13.810
Everyone has started dueling everywhere after the Battle City Tournament.

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:20.550
Kaiba Corporation reduced the price of the Duel Disk so that everyone can play.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:24.550
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.050
Noah...

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:27.970
Huh?

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:29.790
It's nothing.

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:35.800
On the surface, Noa looked the same as these duel-loving kids.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.000
My turn!

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:42.750
Jonouchi!

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:45.710
Jonouchi!

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:50.010
Noa!  I feel sorry for you!

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:50.950
What?

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:54.750
Even though you're smarter, your heart is still immature.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:57.280
You hate what you don't have.

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:59.860
You're nothing but a selfish child!

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:04.730
Ordinary people can't understand my greatness.

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:08.480
Victory only comes to the chosen ones.

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:11.430
Yugi, I choose you.

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:13.430
Say that you'll cooperate with me!

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:16.870
You use power to manipulate people.

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:21.080
So no one will accept you!

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:22.810
You're a fool, Noa!

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:30.320
Noa lost his body and lived in virtual reality, so he was all alone.

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:34.520
He had no friends to play with.

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.820
I summon Summoned Skull!

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.510
I feel bad for him.

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:45.330
Yeah.

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:49.240
Father, let's end this.

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:51.340
I'll be with you forever.

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:55.010
What are you doing, Noa!

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:59.480
Let me go!  I still have things to do!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:04.280
We're already dead, Father.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.850
Let me go!

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:20.930
No!  I don't want to die!

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:29.480
If circumstances were different, we could've been friends.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:30.280
Yeah.

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:36.920
I lost again!  You're tough!

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:38.950
Let's play again!

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:41.960
Yeah!  I won't lose this time!

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:43.460
How nice.

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:50.200
Their duel is just for fun, but Yugi's duel wasn't.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.430
Jonouchi...

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:56.940
I'm going to meet Kaiba at the Duel Ring.

00:14:57.240 --> 00:14:58.350
Yugi...

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:05.470
So Jonouchi, you keep fighting as a duelist!

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:11.860
Everyone, look after Jonouchi.

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:13.790
Yugi!

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:16.260
Wait up, Yugi!

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:19.760
The duel is more important than Jonouchi?

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:23.760
What's the point of this battle?

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.650
It's not just Jonouchi.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:32.620
Mai, Bakura and Rishido were all hurt and collapsed!

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:36.260
All we're doing is losing everyone!

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:37.650
Anzu.

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:42.930
I fight to fulfill my promise with Jonouchi.

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:43.780
Promise?

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:49.790
As long as a person keeps searching for an answer, there's a place he'll return to.

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:51.960
Jonouchi will return.

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:57.180
He will come back to us, happy as always!

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:59.800
I believe this future will occur!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:03.690
Wait!  We don't know why you were in a coma!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.700
You need a thorough exam!

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:07.650
Don't worry about it.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.720
Let's go!

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:10.980
No.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:15.480
The doctor is right.

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:17.820
You need to be examined.

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:21.730
I know my body more than anyone else-

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:23.000
No, you don't!

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:28.220
You were dying!  We were so worried!

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:31.100
And you act like nothing happened.

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:36.100
You should worry about your health instead of the duel!

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:43.480
Anzu...  Sorry, but I have to go!

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:45.240
Jonouchi!

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:49.440
I'm sorry that I made you worry about me.

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:54.020
But Yugi's fight isn't his alone.

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:57.260
It's a fight to fulfill his promise with me.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.260
Promise with you?

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:06.330
Until Yugi and I duel, our Battle City doesn't end.

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:11.840
Yugi and I have both fought to become true duelists.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:16.860
Every duel leads to our future.

00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:19.850
So I want to watch, no matter the result.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:22.800
As long as Yugi's dueling, I'm going.

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:24.350
I need to go!

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:30.140
Yugi and Jonouchi trust each another.

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:35.740
When it comes to friendship between men, there's no place for me.

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.130
Let's go to the next spot.

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:38.920
Okay!

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:45.700
After overcoming many trials, Yugi...

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:51.180
The winner of the Battle City Finals is Yugi Muto!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:56.150
And Yugi finally acquired all three cards.

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.520
Yugi, here's a God Card.

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:05.620
The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.630
Slifer the Sky Dragon.

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:10.560
Obelisk the Tormentor.

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:14.780
I've finally acquired the three God Cards.

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:20.510
These three cards contain the secret of my other self's memories.

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:22.660
But what is it?

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:31.250
And here's the key to the Pharaoh's locked memories that the gravekeepers have kept safe.

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:37.420
That looks painful.

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.050
How cruel.

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:40.390
These scars...

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:47.270
The gravekeepers suffered pain to protect the secret of my memories?

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:53.750
It's a message from a gravekeeper prophet who served the royal family 3,000 years ago.

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:58.720
The one who acquires the three Gods' tablets...

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:02.610
...proves that he houses the Pharaoh's soul.

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:09.540
Yugi, you proved that you are the Pharaoh by acquiring the three God Cards.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:13.230
You may learn the location of your memories, indicated here.

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:18.660
It's that stone tablet!

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:23.280
Are my memories sealed inside that tablet?

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:31.410
He has all three God Cards.

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:35.910
When his memories are unsealed, will the other Yugi...

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:37.360
Anzu?

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:39.720
Earth to Anzu?

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:41.920
What is it?

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:47.930
Umm...  Was it really okay to show me the sights?

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:49.930
Didn't you have something to do?

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:05.480
What?  That's very important!

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:07.350
I guess.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:08.980
"I guess"?

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:11.620
You should've told me earlier.

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:15.850
Since I didn't know, I made you take me all over the place.

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:19.360
It's fine.  I still have time.

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:23.360
Actually, I don't have much time left.

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:28.870
The other Yugi will soon leave me.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.600
I'm going to leave now.

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:36.210
Oh.  Come visit Domino City when you can, okay?

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:40.710
A handshake of friendship.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:47.450
My brother often told me that you're all connected in a bond of friendship.

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:49.720
Bond of friendship...

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:56.460
Now I'm part of the group!

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:58.090
What are you talking about?

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:00.970
You've always been one of us.

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:03.580
No matter how far apart, we're still friends?

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:04.840
Of course!

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:07.340
Great!

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:09.200
Goodbye.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.840
Bye, Shizuka.

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:20.350
Friends even when we're apart...

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:32.360
I may not have many chances left to meet the other Yugi like this.

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:36.890
Friends even when we're apart...

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:40.780
I'll cherish the remaining time we have left!

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:43.470
Yugi!

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:46.980
Yugi!

00:21:56.570 --> 00:22:01.870
The other Yugi will leave on his journey to recover his lost memories.

00:22:01.870 --> 00:22:05.760
That's when someone attacks Haga and Ryuzaki.

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:10.330
The tablet of memories rejects the God Cards for some reason.

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:14.530
And Duel Monsters appear all over the city.

00:22:14.530 --> 00:22:17.120
What's going on?

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:21.000
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Pulse of a New Darkness

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:22.560
Duel, standby!

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:39.250
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:47.590
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:58.750
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:08.270
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:23:08.840 --> 00:23:17.300
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:22.810
I'll live feeling them

00:23:23.420 --> 00:23:27.990
For me to be me

00:23:27.990 --> 00:23:36.450
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:37.130 --> 00:23:42.090
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:42.610 --> 00:23:51.750
We'll both understand that someday
